each member of the madrigal family from  disney's encanto is given a gift that  reflects their personality and can be  used to help the community yet not all  of the madrigal's gifts are equally  useful many adults will notice this  seems to be especially true with  mirabelle's aunt peppa who has been  given the miraculous power to control  the weather while this would normally be  an incredible gift peppa isn't like  storm from x-men who can summon rain and  wind at will instead she's a bundle of  emotions whose mood is reflected in the  weather she conjures as a result  throughout incanto peppa is seen with  clouds hovering above her head  signifying the anxiety she seems to feel  almost constantly peppa's gift is well  suited to her stressed out personality  given how deep her emotions seem to run  however it appears peppa hasn't managed  to harness her feelings in a way that  enables her to turn her gift to anyone's  advantage she's honestly kind of a wreck  and that's something most kid viewers  probably didn't notice but the adults  watching sure did
 

